## Context
Audit finding C2 (`docs/2026-09-24-rules-coherence-audit.md`). The PostToolUse hook in `.claude/settings.json`
runs `tickets/erg validate tickets/`; `validate` takes files and on a
directory prints "use 'erg check'" and checks nothing. Its `tickets/AGENTS.md`
is also an older variant (A2 family). Repo: MinhHaDuong/fuzzy-corpus.

## Actions
Copy the harness `tickets/erg` (rev 63b5e92 or later) into the repo, then run
plain `tickets/erg init` (no `--force`: it refreshes `tickets/AGENTS.md` and
preserves a locally edited `.ergrc`). Verified on a scratch copy of aedist
2026-09-24: AGENTS.md becomes byte-identical to the harness copy, `erg check`
passes.
Then replace `validate tickets/` with `check tickets/` in the hook (and in
any permission allow rule naming `validate` on a directory).

## Exit criteria
- [ ] Hook command runs `tickets/erg check tickets/`; editing a deliberately
      broken `.erg` in a scratch copy makes it print a failure (positive control)
- [ ] `tickets/AGENTS.md` byte-identical to the harness copy; `erg check` passes
- [ ] Merged in the target repo; PR number logged here
